+++
title: A practice that survives a busy week
coach: sam
date: 2025-02-20
domains: creativity
+++

The creative practices that last aren't the ambitious ones. They're the
ones small enough to survive the week you didn't have time for them.

- Set a floor, not a goal (ten minutes, not two hours)
- Protect the floor even on the day you don't want to
- Let the ambitious version happen on the days it wants to, not on schedule
